{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>A man, a man — if he curses his Elohim.</b> Even one who curses the Nasi and bears his sin in lashes, as it is said: ״אלהים לא תקלל״ etc. And one who pronounces the Name of HaShem — ״מות יומת״; one who curses HaShem — like ״מה אקב לא קבה אל״ — ״אותו יומת״, who laid his hand against the very root."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:26.562997792Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}